            "text": "{\"title\":\"One-Pot Peloponnesian Beef and Artichoke Stew\",\"readyInMinutes\":75,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"This \u003cb\u003eone-pot Peloponnesian beef and artichoke stew\u003c/b\u003e brings hearty Greek comfort food straight to your dinner table with minimal cleanup. Tender chunks of stew meat are seared until golden, then simmered alongside tender artichoke hearts, sweet shallots, and fresh dill in a savory lemon-infused broth. Inspired by traditional regional stews, this simplified version keeps the deep flavor profiles intact while combining all components into a single Dutch oven. The addition of tangy fresh lemon juice right at the end brightens the rich savory base, while fingerling potatoes absorb all the aromatic pan drippings. Serving this dish alongside crusty sourdough bread makes for an authentic Mediterranean meal that satisfies the entire family. Rich in \u003cb\u003eprotein\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003eiron\u003c/b\u003e, and essential vitamins, this dish balances hearty meats with wholesome vegetables effortlessly. Enjoy a fragrant taste of Greece with minimal hassle on busy weeknights or lazy weekend gatherings.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":520.0,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":26.0},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":24.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":36.0},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":7.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":37.5},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":32.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":10.6},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":4.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":5.0},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":42.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":84.0},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":115.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":38.3},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":680.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":29.5},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":7.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":28.0},{\"name\":\"Vitamin A\",\"amount\":